   226|    "## Como usar\n",
   227|    "\n",
   228|    "Cole a URL do tunnel aqui no chat. Eu monto o prompt e fa\u00e7o a requisi\u00e7\u00e3o!\n",
   229|    "\n",
   230|    "**Exemplo m\u00ednimo:**\n",
   231|    "\n",
   232|    "```\n",
   233|    "POST /generate?token=YOUR_SECRET_TOKEN\n",
   234|    "{\"custom_prompt\": \"a cyberpunk mage with bionic arms, neon glow, detailed face\"}\n",
   235|    "```\n",
   236|    "\n",
